{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上準疏主原人論釋，與夫\n孤山所指稍異。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "死而後已，故無終始。未有患力不及，而容不行者。故上自天子，下至庶人，皆須有終始也。不目始終，而曰終始\n者，蓋慎終如始。唯有終，則成其始之善。或不能成終，則始雖得之，亦必失之矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准佛名聖，餘皆名賢。等覺聖人，尚名普賢。又三\n藏中，律唯佛制，經論通於弟子等說。故弟子中，亦有聖賢。大則十聖三賢，小則七聖七賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲還終南"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "含文嘉曰：天子之墳高三仞，樹以松；諸侯半之，樹以栢；大夫八尺，樹以欒；士四尺，樹以槐；庶人無墳，樹以\n楊柳。漢無定制，通植松栢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如智度攝論、華嚴大疏、金剛纂要等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如十二門論、圓覺略疏等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如地持論等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如法界無差別論等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問訊也，名下禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長跪也，名中禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即今稽首，名上\n禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是先儒任奉疏語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分九州地。建者，侯國。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "置公卿都，\n立大夫士之邑。此謂王幾及諸侯國中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "親四，始祖一，文武二，祧合為七也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此在七外也。封土曰壇，除地曰墠。近親封土，遠親除地，示將去然。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文廟曰考。考，成\n也。謂父有成德之美。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖廟也。王，君也。言祖有君成之德也。祖尊於父，故加君名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾祖也。皇，大也，君也。曾祖轉尊，故加大君之稱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高祖也。顯明高祖，居\n四廟最上也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖，始也。此廟為王者之始，故曰祖考。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二祧，文武廟也。文武並在應遷之例，故云遠也。特為功德而留，故謂之祧。祧之\n言超也，言其超然上去也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "享甞，四時祭祀也。文武特留，故不月祭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂高祖之父也。昭行寄藏武祧，穆行寄藏文祧。四時不祭，有時祈禱，則出就壇受祭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂高祖之祖也，不得在壇。若有祈禱，則出就墠受祭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若又有從壇遷來墠者，則此前在墠者，遷入石函為鬼。雖有祈禱，亦不及\n也。唯禘祫乃出爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "適士，上士也。官師，中士。庶士，下士。府史之屬。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂至\n德也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂要道也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔子之孫，伯魚之子，名伋，字子思。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此上\n科釋備遵本疏，舊疏、新鈔亦循用之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "啟，開也。衾，被也。使視其體，言今將死而生免毀\n傷，矜誡諸子知而行之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏用此意，故云通信。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此說如來報親，優陀但是傳信。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二子迴邪，尚未出家，則法資居先，而祝髮在後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因尸曰棺，周棺\n曰槨。棺之言完，謂完密於尸也。槨之言廓，謂開廓其土，使不侵於棺也。宅兆，即墓穴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三日廟中，故曰內齋。致謂精至。\n七日廟外，靜定其心，故曰外定。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂想\n其聲容也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "告朔謂月祭。禮：人君每月告朔於廟，有祭謂之朝享，生牲曰餼。魯自文公不親視朔，子貢欲使孔子撤去\n其羊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "召子貢名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "憫其徒死。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羊存猶以識其\n\n禮，羊亡禮遂廢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中心鄉之，祭即見饗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君陳，臣名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂享德不享物。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殷紂外東都，文王為西伯，\n祭祀尚德，故厚不如薄也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古有二解：一曰犬以守禦，馬以代勞，皆養人者；一曰人之所養，\n乃至於犬馬，不敬則無以別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一多羅高七仞。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "溫，席；扇，牀；定，衾枕；省，安居。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "間猶瘳也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊記引此，新鈔乃引高齊道紀，事亦不殊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尚書說命云：王宅憂，亮陰三祀。謂高宗居憂，信任百官，陰默三年。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泣無聲，如血下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言笑之微。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刻其額而涅以\n墨也。其非事出入，不以道義而訟者，則加之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "截其鼻也。革輿服，改制度者，則加之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刖其\n足也。澤關梁，踰城郭者，則加之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "男子則害其勢，女人則幽閉之也。男女不以禮義交通者，則加之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今之死刑也。寇賊劫掠，奪攘矯處者，則加之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "郭璞注：謂放置。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除和尚、阿闍黎。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "涅槃云：間無蹔樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一人獨墮此獄，身徧獄中，間無空處。其獄四方交過，通徹八萬由旬，身與獄等，不相障礙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆彼文排斥，今疏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即經藏也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則正宗分第六，示其正法中五獲勝益之文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此亦正宗分中第八，目連慈母獲益之文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此則流通分答請中二教發願\n之文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤山新鈔亦承用之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上皆孝衡記文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼師破立既有多段，余亦逐節試為\n評之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孤山云：𪪊所救人說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前已辨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有隱，謂不稱揚其過。無犯，謂不犯顏而諫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "左右，扶持之。方，猶常也。子則然，\n無常人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勤，即勞辱之事。致，謂戚容稱其服也。凡此以恩為制。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既諫，人有問其國政者，可以語其得失。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不可侵官。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方喪，謂資於事父。凡此以義為制。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心喪，謂戚\n容如文而無服也。凡此以思義之間為制。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開元錄云附東晉錄是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "春夏秋冬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正月十六日去漸熱時，三\n月十六去盛熱時，五月十六去雨時，七月十六去茂時，九月十六去漸寒時，十一月十六去盛寒時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正月十六去熱時，五月十六去爾時，九月\n十六去寒時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晝四夜四，於一一時各有四分，如西域記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即本生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即本事也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前二章，後二章。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中間二章。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如疏引。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏中不引。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蔚，音尉。爾\n雅云：蒿󴕴。注云：青蒿，謂有子者。蔚，牡󴕴。注云：即無子者。󴕴，去刃反。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瘁，病也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏引後四句，故云乃至。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瓶小而盡，罍大而盈，故為罍恥。刺幽王不使貧富均也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鮮，寡也。生不如死，恨之深也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如疏備引。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "民人\n苦，伇觀南山烈烈然，言其高峻而難至也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "發發，疾貌。言寒且疾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "穀，養也。言他皆得養其親耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "害，音曷。我獨何故觀止寒苦之害。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上烈烈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上發發。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卒，終也。我獨不得終養父母。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日夜燒然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "折草為刀，更相\n殺害"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殺戮屠剝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善惡有記，造成因種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至果成熟，報法\n非記，因果性別，故云異類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即\n大乘，下通大小"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無記有四：\n一、異熟無記，二、威儀無記，三、工巧無記，四、變化無記，謂後三也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人受貧窮\n疾病等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畜有肥好莊嚴等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人受富貴等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畜類有育跛等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七八二識小乘不說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "樂字去呼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼鎖二鬼自屬無財，其舍主者是勢力鬼。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世有目連經，與此經不同，又無譯者，恐是偽本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂人心同，則裁斷成\n決，如刃之利。金性堅剛，而能斷之，喻利之甚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心同言合，如蘭\n之馨，謂其可愛。臭，即蘭之氣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經缺提舍義同吉羅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音定，又音殿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂不常受享，唯能誠信者，則享其祀\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊烟乃高宗時王、楊、盧、駱四才子中\n一也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為眾請法救度父母，非是請問受持遺法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非是付屬受持遺法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "申即國名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共音恭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寤寐中生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "立為太子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共，國名，因\n號共叔段。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寘，置也。城頴，即鄭地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地中之泉，故曰黃泉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與封疆者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繄，語助也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隧，若今之延道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賦，詩也。融融，和樂貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "洩洩，舒散貌。音曳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "純，篤也。施音異。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《論語注疏》（《武英殿十三經注疏》本）第7卷第10b頁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2131_p1072b02"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X42n0736_p0738b20"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X21n0372_p0470c17"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X22n0411_p0415b17"}
{"id": null, "n": "0498002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0498002", "type": "mod", "text": "老【CB】，孝【卍續】，孝字可疑"}
{"id": null, "n": "0485001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0485001", "type": "orig", "text": "器疑哭"}
{"id": null, "n": "0487001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0487001", "type": "orig", "text": "忘疑妄"}
{"id": null, "n": "0488001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0488001 #note_star_1", "type": "orig", "text": "暮疑朞次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0495001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0495001", "type": "orig", "text": "葢疑益"}
{"id": null, "n": "0497001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0497001", "type": "orig", "text": "地疑池"}
{"id": null, "n": "0498001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0498001", "type": "orig", "text": "若疑差"}
{"id": null, "n": "0498002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0498002", "type": "orig", "text": "孝字可疑"}
{"id": null, "n": "0499001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0499001", "type": "orig", "text": "容疑客"}
